    "body": "Sounds good. Anyway, hopefully there will be consensus on the utility of the feature and we can finish the bikeshed :)\n\nRegarding pre/post orientation - we have to make sure we don't expose orientation etc for no-cors images/video.\nSo probably the dimensions in this case should be \"what the rendered dimensions would be for a plain image/video with the selected source as the src and no other attributes/css\", but perhaps I am missing something.",
